Bind Npc 14441 Zone 2
Quest 404 "[Repeatable Solo] Defend the Gravesite"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Caretake] Slay has commissioned you to hunt Shadow Seeker. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 10 of 1003, 1053 at direction_98

Requires player level >= 36 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 500000 experience or 700000 with premium

direction_98 = location "Rotten Eyes" about "Rotten Eyes\nCorpse which has lost volition due to evil energy; undead monster exclusively harboring a hostility against all life forms" found "El Morad" elmorad at 1016 626 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, the mainland has its own Gravesite. Slay defends the site. How about you meet him?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Hello...  I'm Slay, I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to watch over this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I don't know since when, but  Rotten Eyes have appeared around the tomb, and I can't drive them out by myself. They're Zombie Monsters like Undyings, and the problem is they make a terrible mess everywhere, makes the Tomb look awful. Could you try and stop them from coming in and ruining the place?\n\nYou'll get some Armor out of this if you do [Graveyard Keeper] Bottom this favor."

On in_progress
    Say "You must save this Tomb no matter what happens. Please, do your best."

On ready
    Say "Well done master, well done."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Meeting you was possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you very much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've managed this place. This will be quite useful."
